    whyItMattered:
      "Migrating the database to dynamic fetching massively reduces the bundle size and allows the project to include future titles that may not have been available at the time of the initial build.",
    subjects: [
      "Expand README.md",
      "replace mockup img referenced in README",
      "prune legacy igdb database (commit reports 64% smaller bundle)",
